WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.000
[calm electronic music]

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Every coding agent has a usage limit.

3
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:11.690
And it always hits at the worst moment.

4
00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.333
[clock ticking]

5
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:19.567
Mid-task, your agent stops. The limit resets at three a.m., and nobody's there to say continue.

6
00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.233
[music rises]

7
00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.267
Meet Agent Rewake.

8
00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:26.452
When your agent hits its limit, Rewake asks once whether to resume.

9
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.286
Line up what comes next.

10
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.200
[whoosh]

11
00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.167
[chime]

12
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.233
At three oh one, it sends your message, and your agent decides for itself and keeps going.

13
00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.900
Then the next message, and the next.

14
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.357
Send later. Repeat on a schedule. Even cron.

15
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.619
Every thread, on one page.

16
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:54.690
Agent Rewake. Free and open source, for Zed.

17
00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:55.800
[music resolves and fades out]
